      "Among the lightest hoses in the category, genuinely effortless to carry and move",
      "Contracts to a very small bundle, storing in less space than a conventional 25-foot hose",
      "Brass fittings with a shut-off valve at the nozzle end",
      "Nine-pattern spray nozzle included in the box",
      "Very easy for anyone with limited grip strength or mobility to handle",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Lighter construction means lower burst resistance than heavy-duty options",
      "More susceptible to abrasion damage than hoses with denser jackets",
      "Shorter expected lifespan under heavy use than the premium picks here",
